<title>UK: Chase Capital II prices $500 million 30-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Chase Capital II prices $500 million 30-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue, announced on Wednesday by lead managers Chase, Goldman Sachs International and Merrill Lynch has now been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHASE CAPITAL II</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	MARGIN     +50 BP    MATURITY    01.FEB.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE   L24.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  98.828    FULL FEES   1.0 PCT</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    98.828</p>
<p> LISTING    UNLISTED</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		REOFFER YIELD LIBOR +60 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
